  "ruleText": "He-P 1905.01 Notification of a Finding of Compliance. If the department determines that the person in charge is in compliance with the Act, both the complainant and the person in charge shall be notified in writing of that determination.\n\nSource. #5759, eff 12-20-93; ss by #7172, eff 12-21-99, EXPIRED: 12-21-07\n\nNew. #9054, eff 12-29-07; ss by #9351, eff 1-1-09, EXPIRED: 1-1-17\n\nNew. #12534, INTERIM, eff 5-24-18, EXPIRES: 11-20-18; ss by #12677, eff 11-20-18",
